  "body": "## Issue\nCloses #1450\nClaim: cloud/i1450-sonnet\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5 (cloud/i1450-sonnet)\nReviewer model: Opus 5.5 (reviewer subagent)\n\n(Replaces #1459, opened from a branch cut from a stale local base; same change.)\n\n## What and why\n**Problem.** With « Trier par catégorie » off, nothing shows the categories for the moment; legacy 4.0.2 has a button for it (`Favorites.swift:808-846` @ 87fe0d1c). Operator chose option 1 on #1450.\n\n**Cause.** The port only had the persistent toggle.\n\n**Change.**\n- `FavoritesPresentation.effectiveLayout(of:categoriesOnDemand:emptySectionsAllowed:)`: pure rule — flat sort + on-demand → grouped, folded sections shown, empty categories listed in « Drapeaux & Favoris » only (legacy `usesCategorizedFavoritesList`, `showsAllFavoriteSections`, `shouldShowEmptyFavoriteSections`, `:488-497`); no effect in the grouped sort.\n- `FavoritesOptionsModel.showsCategoriesOnDemand`: memory only, never written, reset when the sort setting changes (`:796-798`); light haptic on toggle (`:812`); `layout`, `hasCollapsibleSections`, `canCollapseMore` use the effective layout.\n- Favoris « Options » menu: item « Afficher les catégories » / « Masquer les catégories » (legacy visible labels and symbols; accessibility label « Afficher toutes les catégories » as legacy), shown only in the flat sort. A menu item, not a toolbar button of its own (GAP-1450); the grouped sort keeps its « sections repliées » toggle.\n\n## How it was verified\n- `FavoritesPresentationTests`: `categoriesOnDemandGroupAFlatListAndShowEveryFoldedSection`, `categoriesOnDemandListEmptyCategoriesOnlyWhereTheListKindAllowsIt`, `categoriesOnDemandChangeNothingInTheGroupedSort`.\n- `FavoritesOptionsModelTests`: `categoriesOnDemandAreMemoryOnlyAndResetWhenTheSortChanges` (no setting written, empty categories follow the list kind, reset on sort change, toggle back), `aNewModelStartsWithoutTheOnDemandView`.\n- `swiftlint lint --strict` on the changed files: 0 violations. Linux session cannot build the app: tests were committed first (failing: missing symbols), fix in the next commit; CI compile check pending.\n- Device check owed: flat sort → menu item shows the grouped list; relaunch goes back flat; VoiceOver label inside the menu (may read the visible title).\n\n### Ledger\n```gap-new\nSection: Lists\n| GAP-1450 | Favoris: categories on demand | Toolbar button: with the flat sort, shows the categories for the moment (memory only, reset when the sort changes) | `Favorites.swift:462,488-497,796-846` @ `87fe0d1c` | Item of the Favoris « Options » menu, same labels and same rule | #1450 | ported with changes | #1450 | b |\n```\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CHe5c46W3hT2ZiM9zf)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CHe5c46W3hT2ZiM9zf",
