   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, reviewer subagent, round 2): APPROVE** — head a11e9215\n\nThe change matches legacy `Favorites.swift` @ 87fe0d1c. The categories view is grouped (`:488-494`) and shows every folded section. Empty categories appear only in « Drapeaux & Favoris » (`:496-497`, `favoritesTabBehavior == \"0\"` ↔ `.flagsAndFavorites`). The view lives in memory only and resets when the sort changes (`:796-798`). `reloadSettings()` resets it only when the sort setting actually changed. The visible labels and symbols match `:821-824`. `displayedGroups` is computed, so a toggle redraws the list.\n\n1. **Low**, PR body. Out of date since round 1: gives « Afficher toutes les catégories » as the visible label (code shows « Afficher les catégories », as legacy); names the old `effectiveLayout(of:categoriesOnDemand:)` signature; test list leaves out `categoriesOnDemandListEmptyCategoriesOnlyWhereTheListKindAllowsIt`; no `Reviewer model:` line. Fix: edit the body.\n2. **Low**, `FavoritesOptionsModel.swift:127-130, 139, 144` and `RootTabsView.swift:169`. Untested changes (LESSONS L01): the haptic of `toggleCategoriesOnDemand`; the switch to `layout.groupedByCategory` in `hasCollapsibleSections` and `canCollapseMore` (revert → « Tout replier » disabled while sections are on screen). Fix: a spy `HapticFeedback(perform:)` test, and `canCollapseMore` checked in the categories view.\n3. **Low**, `### Ledger`, `gap-new` row: in French, while the \"Lists\" rows and AGENTS §12 use English (only the changelog summary is French, `tooling/docs/README.md:50`). Fix: translate in the body.\n4. **Detail**, `RootTabsView.swift:160`. Inside a `Menu`, `.accessibilityLabel` is probably ignored (VoiceOver reads the visible title). Harmless, not proven on a device: add to the device check.\n\n**Verified:** `swiftlint lint --strict` on the 5 changed files: 0 violations; `ledger.py check-body`: 1 block ok; legacy read at `:455-500`, `:790-850`; compiler-rigour reading of the `Button`/`accessibilityLabel` overloads, `didSet` order, `@Observable` with `private(set)`, test helpers; every call site of `groupedByCategory` accounted for. **Not run:** app build and app tests (Linux).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
